<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Select text in the chat area by clicking and dragging. Then choose Copy in the Edit menu, or use your browser's copy shortcut, such as %{keys}.",
    keys: "Ctrl+C"
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_features", "Usage")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_features", "1. Click and drag to select text in the chat area.")}<br />{dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "2. Open the Edit menu and choose Copy, or press %{keys}.",
    keys: "Ctrl+C"
  )}<br />{dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "3. The selected text is copied to your clipboard as plain text."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_document_alert}>{dgettext("help_features", "Notes")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "If no text is selected, the Copy option appears disabled. Rich formatting is stripped — only plain text is copied."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_copy}>{dgettext("help_features", "Copy From the Menus")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The Edit menu of the chat window has a Copy item. The View group of the Start menu has the same item. Both copy the text you selected in the message area."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "This Copy item is enabled only while you have a selection inside the message area. Text selected elsewhere on the page, such as in a menu or a dialog, does not count."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_dialog_options}>
  {dgettext("help_features", "Copy a Whole Message or Name")}
</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Right-click a message, or press and hold it on a touch screen, to open its context menu. You do not need to select anything first."
  )}
</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("help_features", "Copy Message")}</strong>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "copies the line with its time and the author's nickname."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("help_features", "Copy Source")}</strong>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "copies the original text with its formatting codes. It appears only when the source differs from what you see."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "Right-click a nickname, a link or a channel name to get Copy Nick, Copy URL or Copy Channel Name."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "These menu items show a short Copied! confirmation when they finish."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-context-menus">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Context Menus")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-copy-feedback">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Copy Feedback")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="ui-edit-menu">{dgettext("help_features", "Edit Menu")}</.help_link>
</p>
